@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - BPO Management System

[*] --> SelectFilterCategory

state "Select Filter Category" as SelectFilterCategory
SelectFilterCategory : entry / select a filter category
SelectFilterCategory : do / display matching users based on chosen criteria
SelectFilterCategory : exit / user selected a filter category

SelectFilterCategory --> DisplayMatchingUsers

state "Display Matching Users" as DisplayMatchingUsers
DisplayMatchingUsers : entry / display matching users based on chosen criteria
DisplayMatchingUsers : do / display results
DisplayMatchingUsers : exit / user views the results

DisplayMatchingUsers --> [*]

@enduml
